keywords:
  - El Niño–Southern Oscillation
  - Relative Oceanic Niño Index
  - early warning
  - forecast verification
  - composite risk index
  - malaria
  - heat mortality
  - systematic review
  - India
  - climate and health
abstract: >-
  Code, results and aggregate data of a pre-specified synthesis of El Niño and health in India: a pooled
  comparison of the traditional ONI, RONI and the Niño-3.4 anomaly across malaria, dengue and recorded heat
  deaths; a hindcast with ENSO forecasts issued before each season; a State El Niño Health Risk Index for 34
  state-level units with Monte Carlo rank intervals; the consolidated 2026–27 outlook; a rapid systematic
  review; and the El Niño Health Vulnerability Atlas of India (docs/index.html). No record-level data are
  included.
